#### Implemented `/*rtl:source:{source}*/`, `/*rtl:begin:source:{source}*/`, and `/*rtl:end:source*/`

##### input

```css
/*rtl:source:rtl*/
.test {
    color: #FFF;
    border-left: 1px solid #666;
    padding: 10px 5px 10px 20px;
    text-align: left;
    width: 100%;
}
```

##### output

```css
.test {
    color: #FFF;
    width: 100%;
}

[dir="ltr"] .test {
    border-right: 1px solid #666;
    padding: 10px 20px 10px 5px;
    text-align: right;
}

[dir="rtl"] .test {
    border-left: 1px solid #666;
    padding: 10px 5px 10px 20px;
    text-align: left;
}
```

